ratorname{sin}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nRecall that if $C$ is a constant, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $f(x)+C$ are\n\n- ${a}_{0}+2C$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- ${a}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- ${b}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nIn our case, $C=5.$ Therefore, the $5$th sine coefficient of $f(x)+5$ is ${b}_{5}$ (remains unchanged)." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-740d0965-87e7-5216-9610-1dfafc6b0bb6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-740d0965-87e7-5216-9610-1dfafc6b0bb6" :answer-field/id #uuid "740d0965-87e7-5216-9610-1dfafc6b0bb6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a55df8d9-38e8-5601-b8d7-deef23e1b3e5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a55df8d9-38e8-5601-b8d7-deef23e1b3e5" "answer-cd941ba1-1704-5611-ad32-048531d05e57" "answer-653fa5e3-ca19-53d8-8efc-1572101bab0c" "answer-48e23fa1-6da3-572e-bd66-77a8a601e92f" "answer-8ee119c9-34d9-54bb-95d1-897eee545a71"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a55df8d9-38e8-5601-b8d7-deef23e1b3e5" :answer/id #uuid "a55df8d9-38e8-5601-b8d7-deef23e1b3e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{b}_{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cd941ba1-1704-5611-ad32-048531d05e57" :answer/id #uuid "cd941ba1-1704-5611-ad32-048531d05e57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{b}_{5}+10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-653fa5e3-ca19-53d8-8efc-1572101bab0c" :answer/id #uuid "653fa5e3-ca19-53d8-8efc-1572101bab0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{b}_{5}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-48e23fa1-6da3-572e-bd66-77a8a601e92f" :answer/id #uuid "48e23fa1-6da3-572e-bd66-77a8a601e92f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{b}_{5}-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ee119c9-34d9-54bb-95d1-897eee545a71" :answer/id #uuid "8ee119c9-34d9-54bb-95d1-897eee545a71